<title>UK: Oftel cuts BT interconnection charges 12 pct.</title>
<headline>Oftel cuts BT interconnection charges 12 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK regulator Oftel said on Wednesday it cut British Telecommunications Plc's 1996/97 interconnection charges by 12 percent compared with last year.</p>
<p>&quot;This reflects the downward movement of costs in telecommunications,&quot; Oftel said in a statement.</p>
</text>
